{"4119310": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Stab Club", "steam_appid": 4119310, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>&quot;A Table. Some Cards. One Goal: Don’t Get Stabbed.&quot;</i></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i> </i></strong> <strong>Welcome to Stab Club</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a seat at the table with the Stab Bots, quirky robotic players built for competition. Everyone’s smiling… until someone gets stabbed! Match the cards that increase each other’s stab points to trade blows in this turn-based tabletop card game. The one with the most stab points at the end? Out! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Simple Rules, Brutal Outcomes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each round, you’ll draw, plan, and play cards to shift the balance. Timing and table awareness are crucial when attacking, defending, or rerouting the stabs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Table Tells a Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Games are quick, but the grudges last. One bad call could turn the tables on you, and one lucky draw could change the outcome. No two matches ever end the same. Every stab leaves its mark.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No Friends at This Table</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trust is a luxury. Every card played could betray you, even from the Stab Bots!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Play Your Way</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against AI Stab Bots or challenge your friends in local or online matches.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>&quot;A Table. Some Cards. One Goal: Don’t Get Stabbed.&quot;</i></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i> </i></strong> <strong>Welcome to Stab Club</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a seat at the table with the Stab Bots, quirky robotic players built for competition. Everyone’s smiling… until someone gets stabbed! Match the cards that increase each other’s stab points to trade blows in this turn-based tabletop card game. The one with the most stab points at the end? Out! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Simple Rules, Brutal Outcomes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each round, you’ll draw, plan, and play cards to shift the balance. Timing and table awareness are crucial when attacking, defending, or rerouting the stabs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Table Tells a Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Games are quick, but the grudges last. One bad call could turn the tables on you, and one lucky draw could change the outcome. No two matches ever end the same. Every stab leaves its mark.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No Friends at This Table</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trust is a luxury. Every card played could betray you, even from the Stab Bots!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Play Your Way</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against AI Stab Bots or challenge your friends in local or online matches.</p>", "short_description": "Whether you’re playing with online friends or AI Stab Bots, Stab Club offers a unique mix of strategy, deception, and competitive fun. Stylized visuals and subtle effects create a memorable, immersive tabletop experience.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Turkish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119310/be622343a3d8e9207fccb318289c48cc77489586/header.jpg?t=1766502255", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119310/da91baf16a24b5572e3f6bd28ff4b9c16079f62d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766502255", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119310/da91baf16a24b5572e3f6bd28ff4b9c16079f62d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766502255", "websit